<title>USA: INSIGHT-NYMEX gasoline only bar to more crude gain.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-NYMEX gasoline only bar to more crude gain.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NEARBY MONTH  CLOSE * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI-14 * MA-10 * MA-20</p>
<p> WTI	     19.69 * 19.55   * 20.00  *   49   * 20.19 * 19.90</p>
<p> HEATING OIL   54.36 * 54.25   * 54.95  *   51   * 56.05 * 54.67</p>
<p> UNLD GASOLINE 61.47 * 61.00   * 62.40  *   46   * 65.21 * 63.66</p>
<p>----------------- VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Aug 12 --------------</p>
<p>*   Crude must get through resistance at $19.75 and head towards</p>
<p>$20, though the latter could depend on support for gasoline.</p>
<p>*   Medium-term charts still look okay for the crude bulls.</p>
<p>*   Heating oil underpinned by double bottom support at $54.25</p>
<p>with ACCESS price action extending this to a near triple bottom.</p>
</text>
